WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:07.109
One of the world leaders most prominently
denying the reality of Corona virus has been

00:00:07.109 --> 00:00:10.120
Brazilian President Gire Balsan.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.570
He has now tested positive for Corona virus.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.670
Now he's 65 years old.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.000
He has trivialized the pandemic.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.750
He would show up places either without a mask
or wearing a mask incorrectly in terms of

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.840
total cases in Brazil now.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.710
They are second in the U.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:30.300
In the world behind the United States in terms
of total deaths.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.450
Brazil is now second in the world behind the
United States in terms of per capita.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:39.870
They are also just below the United States
in both cases and deaths.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:45.350
And Gyroball S.R.O. was bragging in March
that if he were to get the virus, he would

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:51.079
quickly fight it off and recover because he
has a history of being an athlete.

00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:56.320
He then kept going to large events and to
gatherings without wearing a mask or again

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.280
wearing it incorrectly.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:03.489
After announcing that he had tested positive
to reporters yesterday, he stepped back and

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:06.440
took off the mask and said, Look at my face.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.070
I feel fine.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:11.570
He was also recently with a bunch of his top
cabinet members.

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:14.320
Everybody was not wearing a mask.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.310
Now I got messages from people saying, you
know, David, this could be the best thing

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.710
that happens to Brazil because.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:23.880
This is going to change both scenarios, view
of Corona virus, because he got it himself.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:28.189
I think you're very, very wrong, especially
if he fights it off.

00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:31.780
He is going to be reinvigorated about how
this is really no big deal.

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:36.420
And, you know, statistically, he's probably
going to be fine because, again, most people

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.229
do not get very sick.

00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:41.979
Even 65 year olds who are generally healthy
do not get very sick.

00:01:41.979 --> 00:01:47.900
Here in Massachusetts, I believe the average
age of death from Corona virus is like 82

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.980
or something like that.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:53.320
So in all likelihood, a relatively healthy
65 year old is going to be fine.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:59.590
And if he is and he fights it off, it will
actually foment him further, downplaying it

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:01.830
with, you know, see, I told you so.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:05.990
It wasn't really serious if he were to get
really sick.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:11.159
It might change his view, but this guy seems
so off the wall, nuts and disconnected from

00:02:11.159 --> 00:02:13.519
reality that it might still not make a difference.

00:02:13.519 --> 00:02:17.709
And when I was looking online at the comments
about this, you know, a lot of people wishing

00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:19.999
him harm, that is never my take.

00:02:19.999 --> 00:02:21.879
I don't wish harm on anybody.

00:02:21.879 --> 00:02:26.239
I'm recognizing the propaganda value of this.

00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:31.529
And he even posted a video yesterday of himself
taking a pill, which he claimed was hydroxyl

00:02:31.529 --> 00:02:32.739
chloroquine.

00:02:32.739 --> 00:02:37.449
He was laughing in the video talking about
how great he feels and how the medication

00:02:37.449 --> 00:02:40.189
is certainly working well and blah, blah,
blah.

00:02:40.189 --> 00:02:41.319
It's all wacky propaganda.

00:02:41.319 --> 00:02:45.620
I mean, he truly seems to have some kind of.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:47.239
He has an unusual personality.

00:02:47.239 --> 00:02:50.090
I don't want to diagnose anything, but it's
an unusual personality.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:56.939
Now, the other thing about the more prominent
people who get Corona virus is it's believed

00:02:56.939 --> 00:02:59.330
or known me put a different way.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:05.180
There's speculation that when a prominent
person gets corona virus, they are immediately

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.859
getting access to antibody treatments.

00:03:07.859 --> 00:03:12.939
When we've seen the success rate of these
antibody treatments where you take convalescent

00:03:12.939 --> 00:03:17.139
plasma from people who have recovered and
have antibodies and you transfuse it into

00:03:17.139 --> 00:03:23.090
a sick person, the reports I've seen so far
are that that is very, very effective.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:27.859
And there's speculation I don't want to say
anything other than there's speculation that

00:03:27.859 --> 00:03:32.639
when a prominent or wealthy person gets the
virus, they get access to that treatment,

00:03:32.639 --> 00:03:37.989
which is not widely available because of the
limitations you have to harvest, collect plasma

00:03:37.989 --> 00:03:39.859
from people who have recovered.

00:03:39.859 --> 00:03:46.470
And that also may be increasing the success
in fighting off the virus for prominent or

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.629
wealthy people.

00:03:47.629 --> 00:03:49.309
It's mere speculation.

00:03:49.309 --> 00:03:50.980
That's the latest with the Brazilian president.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:51.980
Gyroball.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.981
Sayonara.

